# Dependency lifecycle scripts do not run during npm install / npm ci.
#
# 1. better-sqlite3 ships its Windows/macOS/Linux binaries inside the package and declares
#    "gypfile": false, but npm drops that flag when installing from a lockfile and would run
#    "node-gyp rebuild" anyway. That fails on any PC without Visual Studio Build Tools.
# 2. This project will hold API credentials; not running third-party install scripts removes
#    the most common supply-chain attack path.
#
# If a future dependency genuinely needs a build step, run it explicitly: npm rebuild <package>
ignore-scripts=true
